#: lib/engine.c:128
msgid ""
"*************************************************************************\n"
"* WARNING: The disk has bad sectors. This means physical damage on the  *\n"
"* disk surface caused by deterioration, manufacturing faults, or        *\n"
"* another reason. The reliability of the disk may remain stable or      *\n"
"* degrade quickly. Use the --rescue option to efficiently save as much  *\n"
"* data as possible!                                                     *\n"
"*************************************************************************\n"
msgstr ""
"*************************************************************************\n"
"* AVISO: O disco tem setores defeituosos. Isso significa dano físico    *\n"
"* na superfície do disco causado por deterioração, falhas de fabricação *\n"
"* ou outro motivo. A confiabilidade do disco pode permanecer estável    *\n"
"* ou degradar rapidamente. Use a opção --rescue para salvar o máximo    *\n"
"* de dados possível!                                                    *\n"
"*************************************************************************\n"

